    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d6-a1">

                <pb facs="0053" n="47" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg47"/>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Her Britannic Majesty’s Ship Carysfort</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Woahoo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1843-02-11"><hi rendition="#italic">February
                                11, 1843</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Having arrived at this port, in her
                    Britannic Majesty’s ship <hi rendition="#italic">Carysfort</hi>, under my
                    command, for the purpose of affording protection to British subjects, as
                    likewise to support the position of Her Britannic Majesty’s representative here,
                    who has received repeated insults from the Government authorities at these
                    islands, respecting which it is my intention to communicate only with the King
                    in person.</p>
                <p>I require to have immediate information by return of the officer conveying this
                    dispatch whether or not the King (in consequence of my arrival) has been
                    notified that his presence will be required here, and the earliest day on which
                    he may be expected, as otherwise I shall be compelled to proceed to his
                    residence, in the ship under my command, for the purpose of communicating with
                    him.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, your most obedient servant,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">George Paulet</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Captain.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>To <hi rendition="#small-caps">Kekuanoa</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Governor of Woahoo, etc.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
